/* .la-sheet-handle/.la-details-close are the mobile bottom-sheet's drag handle + close button
   (see the @media(max-width:700px) block far below) — both previously had ZERO desktop CSS at all,
   so on desktop they rendered as a normal, un-hidden, unstyled empty div + button (the close
   button's icon has no stroke color outside that media query either, so it looked blank) sitting
   above "Your details" — exactly the "big blank space at the top, scrollable into" bug reported
   2026-10-31. Hidden by default here; the mobile media query re-enables both explicitly. */
.la-sheet-handle,.la-details-close{display:none}
