   directly in the header, replacing the desktop personal-suite-updated.html header (logo/eyebrow/
   close) below the mobile breakpoint. Appended here (not mixed into the scattered @media blocks
   above) to avoid adding yet another conflicting layer to a selector list that already needed one
   authoritative cleanup pass this session. */
.la-mobile-header{display:none}
.la-powered-badge-sidebar{display:none}
